{
  "itemName" : "ct_sonaveil_pie",
  "shortdescription" : "Sonaveil Pie ^#2080f0;^reset;",
  "description" : "A warm holiday pie filled with sweet and savory fruits and spices. The perfect treat to share during ^#b0e0fc;Sona's Veil^reset;!",
  "longdescription" : "This festive pie combines ^#b0e0fc;cooked gils^reset;, ^#b0e0fc;sonasweets^reset;, ^#b0e0fc;koywa dough^reset;, warming spices, and tonna milk butter into the quintessential Sonaveil dish. The pie keeps its warmth remarkably longer than ordinary pies - some say it requires a touch of holiday spirit to bake properly. Altas share these during the cold solstice, gathering with their sisters under warm blankets, surrounded by hanging scarfs and strip lights, drinking hot tonna yaavi milk. The recipe varies between alta cities, corfals and colonies, each adding their own cherished touches.",
  "altaDescription" : "Mmm, the smell of Sonaveil spirit! Makes you feel like gathering with the girls on the solstice, wrapped in blankets under the holiday lights~ So cozy and warm!",

  "level" : 5, "race" : "alta",
  "itemTags" : [ "alta_cuisine", "pie", "sona", "sonaveil", "holiday" ],
